  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5911.02 EMT Provider Training",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5911.02 EMT Provider Training. The EMT training program shall meet or exceed the standards as defined in the National Emergency Medical Services Education Standards, Emergency Medical Technician, 2021 edition as published by the United States Department of Transportation, National Highway Traffic Safety Administration, available as noted in Appendix B.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19; ss by #13953, eff 4-30-24",
